WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.863
A later confirmation must not be written into an

00:00:02.915 --> 00:00:08.573
earlier decision Keep your original reasoning Now reintegrate the

00:00:08.652 --> 00:00:12.784
parts using the later fictional update Once a problem

00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:15.534
is resolved it can be hard to remember what

00:00:15.613 --> 00:00:19.073
was still unknown at the start We will compare

00:00:19.139 --> 00:00:21.652
the later controlled record with the first brief and

00:00:21.678 --> 00:00:24.678
trace the decisions and evidence that closed each gap
